<title>RUSSIA: Russian trading system index closes up at 353.41.</title>
<headline>Russian trading system index closes up at 353.41.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index closed up at 353.41 on Thursday from Wednesday's closing of 351.40, according to brokers association NAUFOR.</p>
<p>Total market turnover was a healthy $55.6 million.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
